+# Liquity V1 Stability Pool — Rollback Checklist (#997)
+
+Use this if the LUSD yield integration must be disabled or reversed after `Deploy003_StabilityPool`.
+
+## 1. Halt automated flows (immediate)
+
+1. `togglePause()` on `StabilityPoolFacet` — stops mint/redeem auto-deposit/withdraw hooks.
+2. Confirm `isStabilityPoolPaused()` returns `true`.
+
+## 2. Recover funds
+
+1. `withdrawFromPool(amount)` — pull principal from Liquity SP (up to `totalPrincipalInPool`).
+2. `emergencyWithdraw(token, amount)` — recover any stranded ERC-20 on the diamond (admin only).
+3. If ETH/LQTY rewards remain in the pool, call `harvestRewards()` before full withdrawal (optional).
+
+## 3. Update configuration (if needed)
+
+1. `setSpTreasuryAddress(newTreasury)` — redirect future reward routing.
+2. `setRewardRoutingEnabled(false)` — send raw ETH/LQTY to treasury instead of swap/compound paths.
+
+## 4. Full removal (last resort)
+
+1. `diamondCut` — remove `StabilityPoolFacet` selectors via multisig.
+2. Verify no open principal remains: `getDepositedLUSD()` should be `0`.
+
+## Verification
+
+- `totalPrincipalInPool == 0`
+- Diamond LUSD balance matches expected idle collateral
+- Mint/redeem no longer moves LUSD to `0x66017D22b0F8556afDd19e1e5b5f1cbD89a6C337` when paused
+
+## References
+
+- Mainnet migration: `migrations/mainnet/Deploy003_StabilityPool.s.sol`
+- Facet: `src/dollar/facets/StabilityPoolFacet.sol`
+- Library: `src/dollar/libraries/LibStabilityPool.sol`
